---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Export requests and collections (curl, code snippets, Postman, .http)

Usage: rustman export [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  curl     Print a request as a single curl command
  postman  Write a collection folder or request file as a Postman Collection v2.1
  http     Write a collection folder or request file as a .http file
  snippet  Print a request as code for another language or tool
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
